hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1787","[AI-translation] Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey aur Zubair aur Miqdaad ko bheja. To Haatib bin Abi Baltaa ki hadees zikr ki aur uskey aakhir mein kaha: To uskey baarey mein naazil hui: (Ae imaan walon! Merey aur tumhaarey dushman ko dost na banaao). (Bukhari: 4890). Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Eid-ul-Fitr key din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu Bakr aur Umar aur Usmaan key sath namaz padhi. To wo sab use khutbey se pehley padhtey they, phir uskey baad khutba detey. To Allah key Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) utrey. To goya main Aap ko dekh raha hun jab Aap apne haath se aadmiyon ko bithaatey hain. Phir Aap unhey cheertey huey aey yahan tak ke Aap Bilaal key sath auraton key paas aey. To Aap ne farmaya: (Ae Nabi! Jab momin auratein tumhaarey paas baiat karney aaein ke wo Allah key sath kuchh shareek na karengi aur na chori karengi aur na zina karengi aur na apni aulaad ko qatl karengi aur na bohtaan laaengi jo wo apne haathon aur apne pairon key darmiyaan ghadten) poori aayat se faarigh honay tak. Phir Aap ne farmaya jab faarigh huey: Kya tum us par ho? To aik aurat ne kaha jiskay siwa Aap ko jawaab na diya gaya: Haan Ya Rasulullah! Hasan nahi jaanta wo kaun hai. Aap ne farmaya: To sadqa karo! Aur Bilaal ne apna kapda phailaaya. To wo Bilaal key kapdey mein angoothiyaan aur chhallay daalnein lagein. (4895). Aur Aisha ki riwayat mein hai: Main ne tum se us par baiat ki. Aap ne use farmaya jo is shart ka iqraar karti thein momin auraton mein se. (4891). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai. Allah Taala ka qaul: (Jab momin auratein tumhaarey paas baiat karney aaein)."
"1788","[AI-translation] Umm Atiya (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se baiat ki. To Aap ne ham par padha: (Ke wo Allah key sath kuchh shareek na karengi). Aur hamein noha karney se mana kya. To aurat ne apna haath rok liya aur us ne kaha: Fulaana ne mujh se madad maangi thi, main uska badla dena chaahten hun. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se kuchh nahi kaha. To wo gai aur wapas aai aur Aap ne us se baiat ki. (Bukhari: 4892). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur un mein se doosrey jo abhi un se nahi milay)."
